C03: a file count over «the current directory» asks for the folder (FILES1437)

«Dime cuantos archivos .py hay en el directorio actual» (H0701) asks for a count over a working directory BAXY does not have: it is not a shell, and the person's folders are the known ones.

baxy_mind effect_intent: resolve_explicit_clarification_intent recognizes a file count over «el directorio/carpeta actual» («current/working directory») without a named known folder and returns the deterministic clarification of filesystem.known.search with the folder field missing; the App asks for the folder in the person's language with zero operations. Offline probe: the literal and three variants clarify; a count over a named folder, a definition and a prohibition do not. Mind only. Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


